    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        SimWorld: An Open-ended Realistic Simulator for Autonomous <span class="search-hit mathjax">Agents</span> in Physical and Social Worlds
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Ren%2C+J">Jiawei Ren</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Zhuang%2C+Y">Yan Zhuang</a>, 
      
